## Requirements<a id="requirements"></a>

- [Molecule](https://docs.ansible.com/projects/molecule/installation/). The nox
  session installs it; a direct run needs it in your Python environment.
- An endpoint you may change, reachable over HTTPS from the control node. Use a
  lab or a disposable instance, never a production system: the tests write
  through the API.
{# skeleton-variant: activation-requirement #}
{# end skeleton-variant #}
- An automation account with the privileges the collection README documents,
  and a JSON file with its credentials, readable only by you and kept outside
  the repository:

  ```json
  {"key": "<API key>", "secret": "<API secret>"}
  ```

